cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this skill helped your writing, please cite this repository."
title: "Embodied AI Paper Writer: A Claude Skill for crafting top-conference robotics papers"
abstract: >
  A Claude Skill distilled from 63 top-conference papers across CoRL, RSS, ICRA,
  IROS, and Science Robotics (2022–2026), covering writing craft only: vocabulary,
  sentence patterns, paragraph flow, figure/table conventions, section-by-section
  construction, rhetorical pivots, and appendix norms. Built using the
  Nuwa skill-distillation methodology.
